  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 902.07 Medical examiner",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 902.07 \"Medical examiner\" means a person who is licensed, certified, and registered to perform physical examinations as specified in 49 CFR 390.103.\n\nSource. #13684, eff 7-17-2(formerly Saf-C 902.05)",
